WEBVTT

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:01.557
and seeing the absence of inflation

00:09:01.557 --> 00:09:03.504
in the face of money-printing,

00:09:03.504 --> 00:09:06.591
and knowing that international aid payments

00:09:06.591 --> 00:09:09.903
were falling at just the wrong time,

00:09:09.903 --> 00:09:13.864
this made me wonder:

00:09:13.864 --> 00:09:15.959
Could we match

00:09:15.959 --> 00:09:22.009
but just on a much grander scale?

00:09:22.009 --> 00:09:26.462
Let's call this scheme "Print Aid."

00:09:26.462 --> 00:09:29.120
And here's how it might work.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:34.277
Provided it saw little inflation risk from doing so,